  "body_text": "这周开始，由于上海的疫情发生波动\n为了大家伙的安全，应相关部门要求\n浦西和浦东门店的日常营运有以下更新\n浦西店 有容乃大 Lucky Draw\n今日（3.14）开始暂时关闭堂食服务\n，请大家伙通过外卖平台或者外卖的小窗口点单\n外卖平台上也会上架挂耳包和新的分享豆套装，可以时不时翻阅下\n浦东店 有容乃大 Lovely Thoughts\n目前依然可以进园区入店，但需要用微信或者支付宝扫园区和我们店的”场所码“来记录您的来访，请跟随园区门岗和我们店入口的扫码引导进行扫码入园、入店。（港澳台同胞可通过支付宝扫码）\n场所码长得像下面这样的\n一起加油，共克疫情！\n工厂目前还算稳定，线上发货受疫情影响比较严重的温州地区，暂时还无法快递，请耐心等待几天哈~",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这周开始，由于上海的疫情发生波动\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          为了大家伙的安全，应相关部门要求\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          浦西和浦东门店的日常营运有以下更新\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           浦西店 有容乃大 Lucky Draw\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(217, 33, 66);color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;\">\n            今日（3.14）开始暂时关闭堂食服务\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，请大家伙通过外卖平台或者外卖的小窗口点单\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          外卖平台上也会上架挂耳包和新的分享豆套装，可以时不时翻阅下\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           浦东店 有容乃大 Lovely Thoughts\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          目前依然可以进园区入店，但需要用微信或者支付宝扫园区和我们店的”场所码“来记录您的来访，请跟随园区门岗和我们店入口的扫码引导进行扫码入园、入店。（港澳台同胞可通过支付宝扫码）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          场所码长得像下面这样的\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Ra8CwpRWkS8zlvQ4g7ccI24bic8mCvHZTh4Shwf0PRX68FvneacQnyE1wtJ8RQb03qa7LlMqnk9qg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一起加油，共克疫情！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          工厂目前还算稳定，线上发货受疫情影响比较严重的温州地区，暂时还无法快递，请耐心等待几天哈~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
